Important note: This is a simple teaching implementation of A\*. For general graphs, a production-quality implementation should track the best known path cost to each state and allow a state to be revisited if a cheaper path is found. Also, the exact number of explored states can depend on tie-breaking order, so compare the actual output rather than assuming fixed counts.
